          "type": "text",
          "text": "A rectangle x cm by 8 cm is joined to a rectangle (x - 2) cm by 5 cm along a complete 5 cm edge. Their interiors do not overlap and their total area is 120 cm². Find the outside perimeter in cm. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "5.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
